cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "MethodOfSimulatedMoments.jl"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package to estimate economic models by the method of simulated
  moments. It minimizes the distance between empirical and simulated moments
  with global optimizers running in parallel, refines the minimum with local
  optimizers, and provides inference: standard errors corrected for simulation
  noise, confidence intervals and the J-test of over-identifying restrictions.
